==History==
2018
*The Barbarian Barrel was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Barbarian Barrel Draft Challenge]] which started on 23/3/2018. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], gameplay was similar to a regular Draft Challenge, except that one of the players was able to choose who would use the Barbarian Barrel. If the player achieved 12 wins, they obtained the Barbarian Barrel early.
*From 31/3/2018 through 4/4/2018, the [[Shop]] had a special offer where [[Arenas|Arena]] 10+ players could buy an unlimited number of special Fortune [[Chests]] for 1,200 [[Gems]] that guarantee at least 60% of the Chest's contents to be Barbarian Barrel. The Chest was able to generate up to 150% of its contents to be Barbarian Barrel.
*The Barbarian Barrel [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 6/4/2018.
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], increased the Barbarian Barrel’s rolling distance to 7 tiles (from 6.5 tiles). It also allowed the Barbarian Barrel to be placed on the river if a [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] has been already destroyed. The card's description was also changed slightly. It used to read “''It rolls, knocks back and damages anything in the way - then breaks and out pops a Barbarian! How did he get inside?!''”. It also added the Barbarian Barrel to [[Touchdown]] Draft.
*On 4/6/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/6/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the [[Barbarians]]‘ attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.5 seconds).
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], increased the Barbarian Barrel's damage by 17% and allow the user to see where the spawned Barbarian will be after it is used. It also moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Barbarian Barrel from Hog Mountain to Barbarian Bowl.
*On 3/9/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/9/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarian Barrel's cost to 2 [[Elixir]] (from 3 Elixir), decreased its rolling distance to 5 tiles (from 7 tiles), decreased its damage by 9%, and removed its pushback. Due to the range decrease, its Crown Tower Damage was also removed.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/10/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Barbarian Barrel's casting speed to 360 (from 310), its projectile speed to 200 (from 150) and decreased the Barbarian's spawn time to 0.2 seconds (from 0.5 seconds). It also fixed a bug where [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] that were spawned after their parent troops died would be immune to [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] damage.
*On 3/12/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/12/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarian Barrel’s damage by 4%. There was also an unannounced change to the Barbarian Barrel, an increase to the Barbarian's spawn time to 0.25 seconds (from 0.2 seconds).
2019
*On 7/1/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/1/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Barbarian's spawn time to 0.5 seconds (from 0.25 seconds).
*On 4/3/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarian's hitpoints by 13%.
*On 3/6/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarian Barrel's damage by 10.5%.
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], decreased the Barbarian Barrel's width to 2.6 tiles (from 3.9 tiles). This was to fix a bug where the the Barbarian Barrel's width did not match the visual width of the barrel.
*On 5/8/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/8/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarian Barrel's damage by 15%.
*On 4/11/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/11/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Barbarian's Barrel's damage by 8%.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Barbarian Barrel's card info screen.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 7/6/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/6/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarians‘ attack time interval to 1.3 seconds (from 1.4 seconds), but it also decreased the Barbarian Barrel's rolling distance to 4.5 tiles (from 5 tiles).
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Barbarian Barrel from Barbarian Bowl to Jungle Arena.
2023
*On 27/3/2023, the [[Version History#Losers%20Update%20(27/3/2023)|Losers Update]], improved the Barbarian Barrel's collision detection.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14). It also fixed an issue with Barbarian Barrel's sound effects.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Barbarian Barrel's damage by 0.41%.
*On 1/12/2025, a Balance Update decreased the Barbarian Barrel's Barbarian deploy time to 1 seconds (from 0.5 seconds) and decreased the Barrel damage by 4%.
2026

* On 2/2/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Barbarian Barrel's damage by 1%.

